patches/soprano-llamacpp.patch: lowercase + whitespace collapse, per-digit
split, raw UTF-8 BPE with [UNK] fallback, [STOP] as eos. The Soprano GGUFs
in BricksDisplay/Soprano-1.1-80M-GGUF declare it since 2026-10-20.

